NAME
     sysdiagnosed – launchd daemon for the sysdiagnose cli tool

SYNOPSIS
     sysdiagnosed

DESCRIPTION
     sysdiagnosed should not be invoked manually.  Instead, see sysdiagnose(1)
     for information on the cli tool.

SEE ALSO
     sysdiagnose(1)

